    {
      "id": "rnw-stage-07",
      "type": "page-section",
      "label": "07 · Create the public release",
      "position": {
        "x": -190,
        "y": 401
      },
      "width": 520,
      "height": 320,
      "data": {
        "presentation": {
          "glyph": {
            "kind": "icon",
            "name": "Article"
          },
          "baseLevel": "detail"
        },
        "title": "07 · Create the public release",
        "body": "With the approved digest, run the publish script: copy the draft to products/twilite/release-notes/<year>/<id>/root.node in the Twilite LLC repository (create-only; an existing release with different content stops the run), derive its views from the current template, and rebuild the hub so membership and newest-first order travel together. Committing, pushing and publishing the repository are the owner’s to say.\n\n**Who:** It writes only after the owner has approved the release.\n**Left behind:** Release path, hub rebuilt, release listed exactly once.\n**If it fails:** Stop. The step can be run again; it skips what is already done.",
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "release-process",
          "nodeId": "rnw-stage-07"
        },
